<section class="questions-section section-shell" id="questions" aria-labelledby="questions-heading"><div class="questions-heading"><p class="eyebrow"><span>06</span> / Questions</p><h2 id="questions-heading">GOOD<br>QUESTIONS.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>What is the TRAYN standard?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Premium whey protein concentrate, with no compromise on quality. Our Belgian Chocolate pack provides 23 g protein (dry basis) per approximately 33 g serving.</p></div></details><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>How do I order?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Shop Belgian Chocolate, choose your quantity and add it to your cart when available. Review your order at checkout for delivery and payment options.</p></div></details><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Where can I read the full label?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Find nutrition, ingredients and directions in Inside the Pack. Use Back Label in the packaging viewer to inspect the label, or <a href="{{ 'belgian-chocolate-wpc-back-label.pdf' | asset_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">open the original product label</a>.</p></div></details><details><summary><i class="faq-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="question-number" aria-hidden="true">04</span><h3>Does it contain allergens?</h3><span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary><div class="faq-answer"><p>Yes. Belgian Chocolate whey protein contains milk. Read the ingredients and usage guidance in Inside the Pack and on the product label.</p></div></details><div class="faq-end" aria-hidden="true"><i class="faq-rule faq-rule-final"></i></div></div></section>

